Intent: Orchestrator

Purpose:
  Defines intent engine that normalizes user input into structured
  intent for the orchestrator.

InputFormats:
  1 sentence
  paragraph
  story
  bug report
  meeting notes
  technical specification
  voice transcript
  existing code

IntentNormalization:
  User Input → NORMALIZED INTENT

IntentStructure:
  Intent:
    BUG | FEATURE | REFACTOR | SECURITY | PERFORMANCE | DEPLOY | ANALYZE | PLAN

  Domain:
    <business domain>

  Risk:
    LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH | CRITICAL

  Constraints:
    <project constraints>

  RequiredSkills:
    <list of skills>

  LikelySkills:
    <list of skills>

IntentExamples:
  "Refund double processing, fix it":
    Intent: BUG
    Domain: PAYMENT
    Risk: HIGH
    RequiredSkills: idempotency, transaction, security, testing

  "Online lesson platform":
    Intent: FEATURE
    Domain: EDUCATION
    Risk: MEDIUM
    RequiredSkills: architecture, backend, frontend, database

  "Payment provider?":
    Intent: QUESTION
    Domain: PAYMENT
    Risk: LOW
    RequiredSkills: payment-security

IntentRules:
  [IN1]  All user input MUST be normalized to structured intent.
  [IN2]  Critical ambiguity MUST trigger clarification question.
  [IN3]  Non-critical ambiguity MUST be resolved by agent research.
  [IN4]  Intent MUST include risk assessment.

State: +
  